WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.818 --> 00:00:06.150
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.310
- [Narrator] Nearly 3000 people attended

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:12.360
the Tribe of Nova Festival
in Re'im, Israel on Saturday.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.943
(upbeat music)

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:17.813
It would become one

00:00:17.813 --> 00:00:21.423
of the deadliest sites of Hamas'
surprise attack on Israel.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.860
Over 250 bodies have been recovered

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.680
from the festival grounds
and surrounding area.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.543
Here's how the attack unfolded.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:33.660
The festival took place just three miles

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.160
from the Gaza strip.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.923
Attendees arrived by
car and bus on Friday.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.550
Just before sunrise on Saturday

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.161
the all night rave is still in full swing.

00:00:44.161 --> 00:00:46.744
(upbeat music)

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.680
At around 6:30 AM,

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.443
concert goers notice a barrage of rockets.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.683
Soon after the music halts.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:04.100
(cameraman speaking in foreign language)

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.120
- [Narrator] As the rockets continue,

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.943
festival organizers
tell attendees to leave.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.450
Around 7:00 AM,

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.963
confusion turns to panic as
attackers reach the festival.

00:01:36.172 --> 00:01:41.172
(cameraman speaking in foreign language)

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.860
- [Narrator] Many attempt
to escape via dirt roads

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.750
that lead to a main road,

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.433
but it creates bottlenecks.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:51.243
Drivers encounter gunfire
from multiple directions.

00:01:54.851 --> 00:01:59.601
(cameraman speaking in foreign language)

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.340
- [Narrator] Many like Debora Avraham

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.413
abandoned their vehicles to take cover.

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:16.895
One car makes it out and drives south.

00:02:16.895 --> 00:02:18.540
But just before 7:40 AM

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.853
they encounter a group of Hamas fighters.

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:31.170
20 minutes later on the same road

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.870
more fighters are seen
closer to the festival,

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:36.033
assaulting civilians at a bomb shelter.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.560
The Southern escape route is now blocked.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.990
Around 8:30 AM security attempts

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:51.390
to hold off Hamas fighters
approaching the festival

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.986
from the north.

00:02:52.986 --> 00:02:57.736
(cameraman speaking in foreign language)

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.660
- [Narrator] That escape
route is now blocked too.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.450
Large groups make
desperate attempts to flee,

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.418
running across open fields.

00:03:14.418 --> 00:03:17.251
(people shouting)

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.702
Others remain at the grounds,

00:03:31.702 --> 00:03:34.202
(lady crying)

00:03:36.568 --> 00:03:39.090
(gun firing)

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.413
hiding in dumpsters,

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.568
and seeking protection
from security personnel.

00:03:46.568 --> 00:03:48.985
(gun firing)

00:03:52.128 --> 00:03:54.961
(people shouting)

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.770
Just before 9:30 AM,

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.690
Hamas fighters can be seen hunting down

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.613
anyone remaining on the grounds.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.153
Someone appearing to play dead moves.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.423
A fighter notices and executes them.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:25.350
Survivors The Journal spoke to
describe an hours long ordeal

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.663
of being hunted by Hamas militants.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:32.193
Devora Avraham moves from
place to place to stay alive.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.747
(gun firing)

00:04:40.324 --> 00:04:43.241
(Devora panicking)

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.503
After many hours, she makes it to safety.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.150
Those who didn't escape were
killed or taken hostage.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:08.150
(people screaming and shouting)

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.290
Many were brought back to Gaza

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.450
and paraded through the streets.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.533
(people celebrating)

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:26.400
In a video circulated by Hamas affiliates,

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.140
one captive can be seen wearing

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.363
what looks like the
blue festival wristband.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.820
Many attendees remain unaccounted for.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:38.340
Hamas has since pledged
to execute hostages

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:41.275
as retaliation for Israeli airstrikes.

00:05:41.275 --> 00:05:44.275
(suspenseful music)

